  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the position vector of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;position vector of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Position vector of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Position vector of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Area</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>Area</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
